<title>USA: JB Hunt to sell flatbed unit, sees gain.</title>
<headline>JB Hunt to sell flatbed unit, sees gain.</headline>
<dateline>LOWELL, Ark. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.B. Hunt Transport Services Inc said Monday it has signed a definitive agreement to sell its Flatbed division to existing management personnel.</p>
<p>Hunt said that it expects to net $40 million in cash from the deal and anticipates a closing before the end of July.</p>
<p>It added that under terms of the agreement, the sale remains contingent on certain outside financing and other conditions.</p>
</text>
